<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65953" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελεδ-ώνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>care, sorrow</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.517
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cerc.
				7.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρυπνοι μελεδῶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phanocl.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			: rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).363
			</span></i>: in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				447
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				883
			</span></i>, the vulg. readings <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελεδώνων,
				μελεδῶνας</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελεδών</span>) shd. prob. be corrected <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελεδωνῶν, -δώνας</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεληδών</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in sg., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελέτη, δέεται πολλῆς
				μ.</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>.</div>
